  "title": "Jamaican Rice Vermicelli Noodles",
  "description": "A festive and flavorful Jamaican dish featuring rice vermicelli, deglaze-fond, and Jain-friendly ingredients, this recipe is perfect for a special occasion. It is a jammy and bouncy-qq dish that is sure to delight.",
