  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add onion, garlic, and ginger and saute until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add allspice, thyme, and scotch bonnet pepper and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add rice vermicelli and cook for 2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Add vegetable broth and soy sauce, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 5 minutes.",
    "Remove the skillet from the heat and let it cool for 2 minutes.",
    "Fluff the noodles with a fork and serve hot.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh cilantro, if desired."
  ],
